# Classic host / assets (gated)

When Full Width WP, SPA host, canvas clip, SiteAssets, CSP, chrome On/Off, or bulk baseline wave is in scope:

1. Bulk all pages / wired baseline → `.cursor/skills/bulk-classic-to-spfx-baseline/SKILL.md` + `docs/migration/`
2. Otherwise read `.cursor/skills/classic-to-spfx-migration/SKILL.md`
3. Load only the needed reference:
   - Full-width / SPA / 450px clip → `references/host-modes.md`
   - Site Pages chrome hide → `references/site-chrome.md`
   - Images/vendor/CSP/remount → `references/siteassets-gotchas.md`
   - Segoe inherit / font-weight → `references/visual-typography.md` (after `classic-visual-parity`)

## This repo
- One web part per classic page (not a single hub `pageKey` router)
- Classic chrome is **inline per ASPX** — no `ui-loader` / PortalShell AC unless the user asks
- Data = `SPHttpClient`; `@pnp/sp` ask-first
- Visual SoT = `classic-visual-parity` + `uikit-to-spfx-visual-parity`

